Package: conflibertR
Title: ConfliBERT Inference and Fine-Tuning for Conflict and Political Violence Text
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Shreyas", "Meher", email = "shreyasmeher@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R interface to ConfliBERT, a pretrained language model for
    conflict and political violence text analysis. Provides functions for
    named entity recognition, binary classification, multilabel
    classification, and question answering. Also supports fine-tuning
    custom classifiers and comparing multiple base model architectures.
    Models are loaded from HuggingFace via the Python transformers
    library through reticulate.
